  "label": {
    "en": [
      "A black-and-white vintage postcard depicting a large fortress situated on a hill above a river. The structure is composed of several tiers of walls and buildings. The foreground shows the water, likely a river. The printed text on the card includes 'Belgrad' on the upper left and 'Vár — Festung' on the upper right. There are handwritten annotations in purple ink across the card."
